Explanation: The theatrical release date in Germany is now 2026-12-03, and PVOD typically follows theatrical by 45 days. Therefore, the earliest PVOD release date would be 2027-01-07 (45 days after 2026-12-03). Since 2027-01-20 is later than this date, it is technically possible, but the "window_not_open" constraint indicates that the PVOD window has not yet started. This means we cannot publish on that date yet.

